{"id": "striviaqa0157", "pool": "striviaqa", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Robert De Niro won an Oscar for his part in The Deer Hunter. He was nominated for Best Actor but lost to Jack Nicholson for One Flew Over the Cuckoo's Nest. However, he did win Best Supporting Actor for Raging Bull later on.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 8, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "striviaqa0165", "pool": "striviaqa", "n_q_chunks": 5, "onset_chunk": 4, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The English football club that plays their home games at Craven Cottage is Fulham FC. They have been playing there for a long time and it's one of the most historic stadium s in London.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 10, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "striviaqa0173", "pool": "striviaqa", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 4, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The Walker Art Gallery is in Liverpool. It's a major art museum located on the edge of the city' s historic dock land area and houses an extensive collection of European painting s, sculpture s, and decorative arts.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 16, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "striviaqa0181", "pool": "striviaqa", "n_q_chunks": 7, "onset_chunk": 7, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "American singer Er nest Evans called himself Chubby Check er to em ulate the name of Little Richard. He chose this stage name as a playful nod to Little Richard's flam boyant style and energetic performance s, aiming to capture some of that same charisma in his own music career.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 16, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "striviaqa0189", "pool": "striviaqa", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 4, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The ballroom dance that's Spanish for double step is called the Cha cha. It's a lively and rhythm ic dance known for its quick footwork and energetic steps, which makes it perfect for dancing to Latin music.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 11, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "striviaqa0197", "pool": "striviaqa", "n_q_chunks": 5, "onset_chunk": 4, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The Oscar for Best Animated Film in 2005 went to The In credible s.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 7, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "striviaqa0205", "pool": "striviaqa", "n_q_chunks": 9, "onset_chunk": 9, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Big Brother is a reality TV show in which a group of people live in a large house watched by cameras. It was first broadcast in the Netherlands in 1999.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 9, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "striviaqa0213", "pool": "striviaqa", "n_q_chunks": 5, "onset_chunk": 5, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "That would be the FA Cup, which is one of the oldest football competitions in the world. It was founded by Charles William Alcock back in the 1870s and it has been running ever since.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 12, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "striviaqa0221", "pool": "striviaqa", "n_q_chunks": 6, "onset_chunk": 5, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Sufferers, locksmen and dreads are followers of Rast afarianism. This is a religion that originated in Jamaica and has its roots in the culture and history of the island. Ra stafarianism emphasize s beliefs about African heritage, spiritual ity, and social justice. The term \"suffer ers\" refers to those who believe they are going through hardship s as part of their journey toward redemption. Lock smen are people who wear locks of hair on their head, often un cut and sometimes adorned with beads or other items, symbolizing their commitment to their faith. D reads refer to individuals who wear dreadlock s, which are long, thick braids made from natural hair. These styles are not just fashion statements but carry deep cultural and religious significance within the Rasta community.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 41, "carrier_ended": null}
